title: >-
  AffineGaps: Exact biosequence alignment and folding on GPUs —
  Needleman-Wunsch, Smith-Waterman, Levenshtein, Zuker, and Sankoff with Gotoh adjustments and traceback
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
